le.":"234b5b1121ce0c2e.mp3","Gas.":"43f74eaffcbea30d.mp3","Bottle.":"d0ade1efb1a48f48.mp3","Balloon.":"af40c871e00b9409.mp3","Soda and vinegar make bubbles.":"a1c3b873b55da8c6.mp3","The bubbles are a gas.":"a97d668b9280647a.mp3","The gas fills the balloon. It gets big!":"c3d94d599e463e07.mp3","We mix soda and vinegar. The balloon…":"44e20ece800de6c0.mp3","Gets big.":"9f33c0fc4a534e05.mp3","Stays small.":"2df627c6b8a2fd2b.mp3","Soda and vinegar make a gas. The gas needs more room. It goes up and fills the balloon.":"88beb4c8acf49b19.mp3","Listen to the words.":"e8f7167e368ebdbb.mp3","What will happen? Choose!":"e85a11140a31eaad.mp3","Now test it!":"7ea28fa70edfe051.mp3","Listen and say it.":"e40d8287adba3de5.mp3","Lift the flap!":"700b475f59e3b466.mp3","Great job! Here is your stamp!":"0d553e811c3aaca9.mp3","Next lab!":"56627acfbe7d8bf5.mp3","Yes! You were right!":"b13118ff5355f6b8.mp3","Good try! Now you know.":"6e6fa90f707f5a77.mp3","Hello! I am AiCo. Let’s do science!":"8ed0824bfc7aa70d.mp3","Tap the torch first!":"edf140d587473199.mp3","Show this to mum or dad!":"8741be00b465d48d.mp3","Well done!":"069cd7b5a30e8d8a.mp3","Day one.":"b785fc47af12a99d.mp3","Day two.":"b32cbea68318db36.mp3","Day three.":"13a6a5ed89972b13.mp3","Day four.":"8c6802615372307b.mp3","Day five.":"a85782118aef6580.mp3","Light!":"3633d28349462601.mp3","White light goes into the prism.":"35bbb8c0c64d7639.mp3","Middle.":"eca7f8a14fc93d1a.mp3","Ding!":"d083b191cca82e1c.mp3","Нажми на три слова — я прочитаю их по-английски.":"85f732049889b2ab.mp3","Как думаешь, что будет? Выбери ответ, а потом проверим.":"91aeb46868bb09d0.mp3","Теперь проверь опытом! Нажимай на предметы в лаборатории.":"9aae3b2d6b9297b3.mp3","Послушай фразу и скажи её вслух. Потом нажми зелёную кнопку.":"cfcc56a87f32099a.mp3","Подними клапан на странице — там ответ, почему так вышло.":"da5be1c1c4dc2610.mp3","Позови маму или папу — я хочу им кое-что показать.":"6d312a8becf95912.mp3"}